  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the Response to Ukraine Crisis-Affected Persons in Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to enhance the response to those crossing the Moldovan borders as a result of the ongoing crisis in Ukraine. This project complements Moldovan authorities&#x2019; ongoing efforts to address the humanitarian needs by collecting, analysing and providing critical information to the authorities and donors for a better targeted response; procuring critical non-food items for those most in need; and strengthening the operational capacity of local border authorities to ensure the swift and dignified processing of conflict-affected people incoming from Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
